Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 20:53:32 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] feat(inspect,edit,convert): agent-addressable read model,
 guarded edit plans, PNG page raster

- xmllinq::parse: attribute loop always advances; validate_xml structural
  admission (single root, no DTD, predefined entities, depth <= 256).
- inspect: body paragraphs with ids, style, numbering, table membership,
  formatting spans and per-paragraph limitations (unsupported constructs no
  longer refuse the document); summary over OPC relationships; Markdown
  projection carrying paragraph ids; inspect_json snapshot with SHA-256.
- edit: versioned EditPlan JSON (replace/insert/delete text, comment,
  insert_paragraph, delete_paragraph) with unique anchors, source hash guard,
  overlap detection and existing-revision policy; operations applied to a
  copy, comments authored there and carried through compare; per-operation
  report with JSONL export.
- convert: raster backend painting the layout display list to PNG
  (tiny-skia + TrueType outlines); render() yields PDF, PNG pages and a page
  report (page count, per-page text, fonts) from one layout pass.
- plans: 00-ASSESSMENT.md records the critique and corrections.

